{"seq":3,"slug":"network-state-detection","title":"网络状态检测与切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/network-state-detection","wordCount":1467,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络状态检测与切换\">网络状态检测与切换</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络状态检测为同步引擎提供决策输入。核心概念包括：网络连续谱模型（非二元开关）、平台原生监测 API（NWPathMonitor / ConnectivityManager）、应用层真实连通性探测、有限状态机驱动的同步策略、网络切换竞态处理（去抖动 + 幂等）、以及自适应同步参数调节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络感知是同步决策的输入信号\">网络感知是同步决策的输入信号</h2><p>离线优先架构中，网络状态不是一个二元开关（在线/离线），而是一个连续谱——从完全断网、弱信号高丢包、受限连接（Captive Portal）、计费网络到高速 Wi-Fi。同步引擎需要根据当前网络质量动态调整行为：什么时候推送变更、推送多大的批次、是否压缩、是否延迟非关键同步。</p>\n<p>网络状态检测的三个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>连通性判断</strong>：设备是否能真正到达同步服务端（而非仅仅连上了 Wi-Fi 热点）</li>\n<li><strong>质量评估</strong>：当前连接的带宽、延迟、丢包率如何</li>\n<li><strong>成本感知</strong>：用户是否在计费网络（蜂窝数据）上，是否设置了省流模式</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"平台原生网络监测-api\">平台原生网络监测 API</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td><code>NWPathMonitor</code></td>\n<td>接口类型、受限状态、代价标记</td>\n<td>不检测真实端到端连通性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td><code>ConnectivityManager</code> + <code>NetworkCallback</code></td>\n<td>网络类型、带宽估算、验证状态</td>\n<td>Android 7+ 才有完整回调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flutter</td>\n<td><code>connectivity_plus</code> + <code>internet_connection_checker</code></td>\n<td>跨平台封装</td>\n<td>底层仍依赖平台 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React Native</td>\n<td><code>@react-native-community/netinfo</code></td>\n<td>类型、isConnected、细节</td>\n<td>准确度依赖平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ios-nwpathmonitor\">iOS：NWPathMonitor</h3><p>iOS 从 iOS 12 引入 <code>NWPathMonitor</code>，取代了过时的 <code>SCNetworkReachability</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import Network&#10;&#10;final class NetworkMonitor {&#10;    private let monitor = NWPathMonitor()&#10;    private let queue = DispatchQueue(label: &quot;NetworkMonitor&quot;)&#10;&#10;    var currentPath: NWPath { monitor.currentPath }&#10;&#10;    func start(onChange: @escaping (NWPath) -&gt; Void) {&#10;        monitor.pathUpdateHandler = onChange&#10;        monitor.start(queue: queue)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func stop() { monitor.cancel() }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用示例&#10;let monitor = NetworkMonitor()&#10;monitor.start { path in&#10;    switch path.status {&#10;    case .satisfied:&#10;        // 网络可用——但可能是 Captive Portal&#10;        if path.isExpensive {&#10;            // 蜂窝网络，限制同步批次大小&#10;        }&#10;    case .unsatisfied:&#10;        // 完全离线，暂停同步引擎&#10;    case .requiresConnection:&#10;        // 需要用户操作（如 VPN 连接）&#10;    @unknown default: break&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Network</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monitor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NWPathMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DispatchQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NetworkMonitor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentPath: NWPath { monitor.currentPath }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (NWPath) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        monitor.pathUpdateHandler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onChange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        monitor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: queue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { monitor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monitor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NetworkMonitor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">monitor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.status {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .satisfied</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 网络可用——但可能是 Captive Portal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.isExpensive {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 蜂窝网络，限制同步批次大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .unsatisfied</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 完全离线，暂停同步引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .requiresConnection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 需要用户操作（如 VPN 连接）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>NWPathMonitor</code> 的关键属性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>isExpensive</code>：蜂窝数据或个人热点，应减少同步频率</li>\n<li><code>isConstrained</code>：低数据模式（Low Data Mode），应仅同步关键数据</li>\n<li><code>supportedInterfaceTypes</code>：区分 <code>.wifi</code> / <code>.cellular</code> / <code>.wiredEthernet</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"android-connectivitymanager-networkcallback\">Android：ConnectivityManager + NetworkCallback</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class NetworkStateTracker(context: Context) {&#10;    private val cm = context.getSystemService&lt;ConnectivityManager&gt;()!!&#10;&#10;    private val callback = object : ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback() {&#10;        override fun onAvailable(network: Network) {&#10;            // 网络连接建立&#10;            onNetworkStateChanged(NetworkState.CONNECTED)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        override fun onLost(network: Network) {&#10;            // 网络断开&#10;            onNetworkStateChanged(NetworkState.DISCONNECTED)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        override fun onCapabilitiesChanged(&#10;            network: Network,&#10;            caps: NetworkCapabilities&#10;        ) {&#10;            val validated = caps.hasCapability(&#10;                NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_VALIDATED&#10;            )&#10;            val notMetered = caps.hasCapability(&#10;                NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_NOT_METERED&#10;            )&#10;            val bandwidth = caps.linkDownstreamBandwidthKbps&#10;&#10;            onNetworkQualityChanged(validated, notMetered, bandwidth)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun register() {&#10;        val request = NetworkRequest.Builder()&#10;            .addCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET)&#10;            .build()&#10;        cm.registerNetworkCallback(request, callback)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class NetworkStateTracker(context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cm = context.getSystemService&#x3C;ConnectivityManager>()!!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val callback = object : ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun onAvailable(network: Network) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 网络连接建立</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onNetworkStateChanged(NetworkState.CONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun onLost(network: Network) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 网络断开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onNetworkStateChanged(NetworkState.DISCONNECTED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override fun onCapabilitiesChanged(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            network: Network,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            caps: NetworkCapabilities</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val validated = caps.hasCapability(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_VALIDATED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val notMetered = caps.hasCapability(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_NOT_METERED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val bandwidth = caps.linkDownstreamBandwidthKbps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onNetworkQualityChanged(validated, notMetered, bandwidth)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun register() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val request = NetworkRequest.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addCapability(NetworkCapabilities.NET_CAPABILITY_INTERNET)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cm.registerNetworkCallback(request, callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 的 <code>NET_CAPABILITY_VALIDATED</code> 标志尤其重要——它表示系统已验证该网络能真正访问互联网（通过 HTTP 探测），而非仅仅连上了一个无出口的 Wi-Fi。</p>\n<h2 id=\"真实连通性探测\">真实连通性探测</h2><p>平台 API 只能告诉你「网络接口是否连接」，无法确认「能否到达你的同步服务端」。生产环境中常见场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>酒店 Wi-Fi 连上了但需要网页认证（Captive Portal）</li>\n<li>企业防火墙封锁了特定端口</li>\n<li>DNS 解析失败</li>\n<li>目标服务端本身宕机</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此需要额外的应用层探测：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[平台回调: 网络可用] --&gt; B{探测同步端点}&#10;    B --&gt;|HEAD /health 200| C[真正在线]&#10;    B --&gt;|超时/非200| D[假在线状态]&#10;    C --&gt; E[启动同步引擎]&#10;    D --&gt; F[维持离线模式]&#10;    F --&gt; G[指数退避重试探测]&#10;    G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[平台回调: 网络可用] --&gt; B{探测同步端点}\n    B --&gt;|HEAD /health 200| C[真正在线]\n    B --&gt;|超时/非200| D[假在线状态]\n    C --&gt; E[启动同步引擎]\n    D --&gt; F[维持离线模式]\n    F --&gt; G[指数退避重试探测]\n    G --&gt; B</pre><p>探测策略设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用轻量级 endpoint（如 <code>HEAD /api/sync/health</code>），响应体为空</li>\n<li>超时设置短（3-5 秒），避免阻塞同步决策</li>\n<li>探测失败后指数退避：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(t_0 \\times 2^n, t_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 = 5\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\max} = 300\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>在探测成功后重置退避计数器</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"网络状态机模型\">网络状态机模型</h2><p>将网络状态建模为有限状态机，使同步引擎的决策逻辑清晰可测：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Unknown&#10;    Unknown --&gt; Offline : 平台回调 unsatisfied&#10;    Unknown --&gt; Probing : 平台回调 satisfied&#10;    Probing --&gt; Online : 探测成功&#10;    Probing --&gt; CaptivePortal : 302 重定向&#10;    Probing --&gt; Offline : 探测超时&#10;    Online --&gt; Offline : 平台回调 lost&#10;    Online --&gt; Degraded : RTT &gt; 阈值&#10;    Degraded --&gt; Online : RTT 恢复&#10;    Degraded --&gt; Offline : 连续 3 次探测失败&#10;    CaptivePortal --&gt; Online : 用户完成认证&#10;    Offline --&gt; Probing : 平台回调 available\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Unknown\n    Unknown --&gt; Offline : 平台回调 unsatisfied\n    Unknown --&gt; Probing : 平台回调 satisfied\n    Probing --&gt; Online : 探测成功\n    Probing --&gt; CaptivePortal : 302 重定向\n    Probing --&gt; Offline : 探测超时\n    Online --&gt; Offline : 平台回调 lost\n    Online --&gt; Degraded : RTT &gt; 阈值\n    Degraded --&gt; Online : RTT 恢复\n    Degraded --&gt; Offline : 连续 3 次探测失败\n    CaptivePortal --&gt; Online : 用户完成认证\n    Offline --&gt; Probing : 平台回调 available</pre><p>每个状态对应不同的同步策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>同步行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Online</td>\n<td>全速同步，实时推送变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Degraded</td>\n<td>降低频率，增大批次，启用压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CaptivePortal</td>\n<td>暂停同步，提示用户完成认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offline</td>\n<td>完全暂停同步，变更入队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Probing</td>\n<td>暂停同步，等待探测结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网络切换的竞态处理\">网络切换的竞态处理</h2><p>移动设备频繁在 Wi-Fi 和蜂窝之间切换（如从家里走到户外）。切换瞬间可能出现：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>旧连接已断开但新连接尚未建立（短暂离线间隙）</li>\n<li>两个连接短暂并存（Android 的 <code>onAvailable</code> 可能先于 <code>onLost</code> 触发）</li>\n<li>切换后 IP 变化导致已建立的 TCP/WebSocket 连接重置</li>\n</ol>\n<p>防护措施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>去抖动（Debounce）</strong>：网络状态变化后等待 1-2 秒再做同步决策，避免频繁切换时反复启停</li>\n<li><strong>连接池复用</strong>：使用 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3（QUIC）减少连接建立开销；QUIC 基于 UDP，天然支持连接迁移（IP 变化不中断流）</li>\n<li><strong>同步操作幂等</strong>：即使同一批变更因网络切换被重复发送，服务端也能安全处理（参见 <a href=\"../sync-engines/sync-protocol-design\">同步协议设计</a> 中的幂等性保证）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自适应同步策略\">自适应同步策略</h2><p>结合网络状态与设备资源，动态调整同步参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>参数调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wi-Fi + 充电</td>\n<td>全量同步、大附件上传、预拉取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wi-Fi + 电池</td>\n<td>正常同步，限制大附件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜂窝 + Low Data Mode</td>\n<td>仅关键数据同步，文本优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜂窝 + 电量 &lt; 20%</td>\n<td>仅同步 mutation queue 中待处理项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱网 (RTT &gt; 2s)</td>\n<td>增大批次、启用 gzip/brotli 压缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种自适应逻辑与 <a href=\"../operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization\">带宽与电量优化</a> 中的调度策略相互配合，共同构成移动端同步的资源管理层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户感知与-ui-反馈\">用户感知与 UI 反馈</h2><p>网络状态的变化应该在 UI 层有适当的反馈，但不应该打断用户操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>离线指示器</strong>：顶部轻量 banner 或状态栏图标，告知用户当前处于离线模式</li>\n<li><strong>同步状态指示</strong>：每条记录旁的小图标（对勾 = 已同步，云 = 同步中，感叹号 = 同步失败）</li>\n<li><strong>冲突提示</strong>：只在需要用户决策时弹出，自动解决的冲突不打扰用户</li>\n<li><strong>永不阻断操作</strong>：即使离线，所有写操作都应立即成功（写入本地），后台排队同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设计原则是让用户<strong>信任应用会处理好同步</strong>，而非逼用户理解分布式系统的复杂性。<a href=\"offline-first-principles\">离线优先设计原则</a> 中的「网络可选」原则在此落地为具体的 UI 模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网络状态检测是同步系统的感知层——它将物理世界的网络波动转化为同步引擎可消费的结构化信号。通过平台 API 快速感知 + 应用层探测确认真实连通性 + 状态机模型驱动策略切换，同步系统能在各种网络条件下做出最优决策。去抖动和幂等设计则保证了网络频繁切换时系统的稳定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络状态检测与切换","id":"网络状态检测与切换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网络感知是同步决策的输入信号","id":"网络感知是同步决策的输入信号"},{"level":2,"text":"平台原生网络监测 API","id":"平台原生网络监测-api"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS：NWPathMonitor","id":"ios-nwpathmonitor"},{"level":3,"text":"Android：ConnectivityManager + NetworkCallback","id":"android-connectivitymanager-networkcallback"},{"level":2,"text":"真实连通性探测","id":"真实连通性探测"},{"level":2,"text":"网络状态机模型","id":"网络状态机模型"},{"level":2,"text":"网络切换的竞态处理","id":"网络切换的竞态处理"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应同步策略","id":"自适应同步策略"},{"level":2,"text":"用户感知与 UI 反馈","id":"用户感知与-ui-反馈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本地存储策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/foundations/local-storage-strategies"},"next":{"title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/sync-protocol-design"}}